## Gap Analysis (From Audit)

| ID | Component | Current State | Target State | Severity |
|----|-----------|---------------|--------------|----------|
| G1 | **CLI Tool Foundation** | No workspace exists | `sang-logium-data/` with TypeScript | CRITICAL |
