## Files at Risk of Regression

| File | Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------|------------|
| `sang-logium/data/catalogue-index.json` | Copy might become stale | Sync command in workspace setup |
| `sanity.types.ts` | Schema drift affects transforms | Use `Pick<SanityProduct, ...>` pattern |
| Environment variables | Missing tokens break upload | `.env.example` with clear instructions |

