## Verification Commands

```bash
# Workspace setup verification
cd sang-logium-data && npm run build

# Individual component tests
npm run test:plan-management
npm run test:web-scraper
npm run test:data-transform
npm run test:validation-system
npm run test:sanity-upload

# Full pipeline test
npm run test:e2e-pipeline

# Pre-sprint regression (main project)
cd ../sang-logium && npm run build && npm run test
```

