## Integration with Existing Architecture

### Sanity Integration Points
- **Catalogue Index**: Copy from main project for validation
- **Generated Types**: Use `Pick<SanityProduct, ...>` pattern (per lesson)
- **GROQ Queries**: Verify field types before reference syntax (per lesson)
- **Brand Resolution**: Exact string matching only (no fuzzy matching)

### Data Flow Compliance
- **Server-Driven**: All data processing server-side (per lesson)
- **Type Safety**: Generated types with `Pick` pattern (per lesson)
- **Schema Validation**: Verify before using reference syntax (per lesson)

